    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everplant currently is in a very early work-in-progress state</h2><br>Everplant is an open-world sandbox game that allows you to customize the entire world. There are no limitations to your creativity. <br>Explore an infinite large, procedurally generated world to gather the necessary resources to reach far away planets. Build your own house with your best friends - but be careful, monsters might attack you. Dig for valuable resources to arm yourself from dangers and become a professional farmer. <br><br>If you prefer a peaceful atmosphere, become friends with monsters, or at least try to - monsters can become very vicious sometimes. If you manage to make a friendship with one of these little creatures, this can become quiet helpful in the end.<br>If you consider yourself a collector, you prove yourself by completing numerous albums. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517380/extras/66e153cb63a114dad4ead41f17cee944.avif?t=1610436187\" /></div><br><br>The Everplant game developement journey has just started! Feel free to join me, Jesper, and support this project by adding Everplant to your wishlist :)",
